Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  嘿  你们大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,hey,you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我生日当天晚上订不到餐厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't get a reservation for the night of my birthday..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要改到星期四晚上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so we'll have to do dinner Thursday night instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星期四  但那是万圣节耶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thursday? But that's Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是很诡异而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just spooky,that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  麦克也会跟我们吃晚餐吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So,is Mike coming to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  我第一次可以跟男朋友过生日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. It's my first birthday with a boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他却要上班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he has to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想对他发脾气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd get mad at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我想这会太快露出我的本性\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I think it's too soon to show my true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你只预定5个人的餐位就可以了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh phobs, I would make the reservation for five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们其中一个要留下来照顾艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because one of us has to stay with Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩应该谁去呢  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Which one of us should go to dinner?  Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我想或许我们两个都可以去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually,I was thinking maybe both of us could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我会多用点心准备你的礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. I'll put a lot of extra thought into your gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  太棒了  我们全部都可以去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,so great,we can all go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒  你们知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is fun! Hey! You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们六个人已经很久没有这样在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We all haven't been together,the six of us,in such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:00:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就在一起啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.85,0:01:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莫妮  钱德勒并不在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon? Chandler's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.07,0:01:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  老天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第5集   菲比的生日晚宴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E05 The One With Phoebe's Birthday Dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（塔尔萨）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  很高兴第一次我们全员到齐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. It's nice to see our team together for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  在我们开始之前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now,before we get started,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题要问吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}are there any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  肯  对吧  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Yes. Ken,is it?  That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有传闻说你之所以会来塔尔萨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it true the reason you're in Tulsa is,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你在开会的时候睡着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you fell asleep in a meeting..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后随口接下此份工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and took the job
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实你根本搞不清是来干什么的  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}without realizing what you were saying yes to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.47,0:02:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别道听途说  肯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,don't believe everything you hear,Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是没错  那是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But yeah,that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们先开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,let's get started
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看一下上一季的数字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}by taking a look at last quarter's figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳蒂亚  你该先\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Claudia,aren't you supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问一下老板可不可以抽烟吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to blow smoke up the boss's ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  你介意我抽烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Does the smoke bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我抽了好多年  然后戒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I smoked for years. Then I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在也忘了为什么要戒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right now,I can't remember why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在办公室不准抽烟的  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not allowed to smoke in this office,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以的  在奥克拉荷马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes,in Oklahoma
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.45,0:02:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在15人以下的办公室抽烟是合法的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's legal to smoke in offices with 15 people or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.79,0:02:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要来一根吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  听着  我戒烟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,look. I don't smoke anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们其他人也想抽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if the rest of you want to light up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请便  没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}go ahead,it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们全部都抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So,you all smoke,then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我不抽烟反而看起来很没礼貌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know,it's almost rude that I'm not smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没那回事  如果你不想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not true. If you don't want..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ken,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  我不能抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,I can't. I can't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我抽烟  我老婆会杀了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I smoke,my wife would kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  但你老婆不是在纽约吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry,but isn't your wife back in New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都很喜欢你  肯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've always liked you,Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不给糖就捣蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Trick or treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  真是大饱眼福呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey.  And "treat" it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  幸好我有换衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. So glad I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我差一点就穿上那件\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I almost wore my threadbare robe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连胸部都遮不住的破睡袍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that can't contain my breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是要穿这件出门  我正在排卵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is not what I'm wearing. I'm ovulating..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而钱德勒很快就回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and Chandler's gonna be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我觉得可以在晚餐前尝试受孕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So,I thought we would try before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  这表示你们会迟到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait,does this mean you'll be late?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  钱德勒和我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Believe me, Chandler and I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经超过一个星期没有见面了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}haven't seen each other in over a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能会是第一个到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll probably be the first ones there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  待会见  祝你们搞的愉快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. See you there. Happy humping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.93,0:03:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  有人在这里抽烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow,somebody smoked out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  难道他们不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God,don't people know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在公共场所是不可以抽烟的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you're not allowed to smoke in public spaces?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  在奥克拉荷马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually,in Oklahoma
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在少于15人的办公室抽烟是合法的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}smoking's legal in offices with fewer than 15 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  你抽烟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,you smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我只是刚好知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I just happen to know
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不同州的抽烟规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a lot of trivia about smoking in different states.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,例如  在夏威夷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For example,in Hawaii,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香烟叫做雷拉纳路卡斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}cigarettes are called leilanalukus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德勒  你身上都是臭烟味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,Chandler,you stink of cigarettes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得莫妮卡会闻得到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you think Monica will smell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那女人的鼻子像猎犬一样灵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That woman has the nose of a bloodhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胸部像希腊女神一样美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the breasts of a Greek goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  有什么可以掩盖味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Something to cover the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,炉灶清洁剂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oven cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无添加香味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unscented.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.07,0:05:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要跟我进房间吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to join me in the bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  谢了  不用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,thanks,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你想玩欲擒故纵  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So you want to play it that way,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  事实上  我才刚下飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,you know what,actually,I just got off a plane..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,觉得有点脏  我应该先洗个澡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so I'm feeling gross. I should take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  你不需要洗澡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here,you don't need a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  事实上是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,the truth is..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在遇到空中乱流时  我拉屎进裤子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I soiled myself during some turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么味道  我闻到烟味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do I smell? I smell smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有抽烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有  但是只抽了一根\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. But I just had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.91,0:05:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两根\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两小根  好吧  五根\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two tiny cigarettes. Okay,five.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一包  两包  一条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A pack. Two pack.. A carton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两天抽三大条香烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three big fat cartons in two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是都结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经决定  再也不抽烟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've made a decision,I'm not gonna smoke anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是要送给你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,those are for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  嗯  到时候见  拜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Well,we'll just see you when you get here. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  是我妈  她遇到大塞车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,that was my mom. She's stuck in terrible traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这是第三个征兆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ok, that is now the third sign
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我不该离开艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that I should not leave Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另外两个征兆是什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are the other two?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  第一个是  我不想要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,the first one is,I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第二个是  我不要去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And second one,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是我们第一次离开宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know this is the first time we're leaving the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这对你很困难  但是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know how hard it is for you. But..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是一切都会很好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我妈会在这里照顾她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean,my mom is gonna be with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很会照顾小孩的 真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} She's great with kids.  She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那莫妮卡是什么情况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只听到莫妮卡的片面之词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You only hear Monica's side of that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那肥妹是个恐怖份子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}that little fatso was a terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我办不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你可以的  你也必须那样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, you know what? You can and you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.05,0:06:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  这对你是有好处的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really,it will be good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact,you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先去餐厅  我留下来等我妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go ahead to the restaurant,and I will wait for my mom..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我再过去找你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  真的  你应该过去  出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,no,really,you should go. Go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  世界都是你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really,the world is your oyster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甩开高跟鞋  挥洒出自己的颜色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kick up your heels. Paint the town red!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该学些新的广告词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You need to learn some new slang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说真的  走吧  你该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm serious. Come on,you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来  去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here. No,just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那 不  不你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Well..  No,no! You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别想要进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not getting back in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.41,0:07:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝没事的  现在快走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The baby's fine. Now,scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着你的感觉向前冲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell your story walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要说  我忘记带钥匙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just going to say that I left my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天啊  这下我们惨了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Holy moley,are we in a pickle now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们人呢  已经迟到四十分钟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where is everyone? They're 40 minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我饿死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I know.  I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们今晚要来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew we were coming here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.39,0:07:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我整天都没有吃东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I ate nothing all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我呢  我今天才吃一顿午餐而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about me? I only had one lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  其他的贵宾很快就会到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So,are we expecting the rest of our party shortly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们衷心期盼他们的即将到临\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes,they are expected presently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们  他们即将现身了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Theirtheir arrival is in the offing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我们也有两人座的位置\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. We have a table for two available.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你们  不用  他们就要来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Perhaps you'd..  No,they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在这里等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're waiting right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔瑟夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您无需担心  他们应该不会太久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One needn't worry. They shan't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一些人在等着要用餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that we do have some large parties waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您真的有必要这样烦人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,one really does have a stick up one's ass,doesn't one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么年纪了  竟然还抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can you smoke in this day and age?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有看过反烟广告吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you not seen that ad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个小孩穿过他爷爷那个广告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where the little kid walks through Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是吓死人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's chilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.87,0:08:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时正开会  每个人都在抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a meeting. Everybody was smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那又如何  你难道没有任何意志力吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what? Don't you have any willpower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意志力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Willpower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看过你吃巧克力的家庭录影带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've watched home movies of you eating Ding Dongs..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连包装纸都来不及打开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}without taking the tinfoil off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说那看起来很性感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said that was sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  可不可以算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,look,can we just drop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再抽烟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna smoke again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  因为我禁止你抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right,because I forbid you to smoke again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你禁止我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You forbid me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我大老远飞回来见我可爱的老婆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I've flown a long way to see my loving wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  她在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is she here,by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德勒  别开玩笑  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler,don't joke with me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在非常非常地不高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm very,very upset right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是你最不高兴的时候吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this the most upset you could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  我何不就\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,then I might as well..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不确定接下来要干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not really sure what to do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你我们接下来要做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll tell you what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经迟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're already late
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.83,0:09:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶不上菲比的生日晚餐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}for Phoebe's birthday dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要把香烟熄掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you're going to put out that cigarette..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们先暂停吵架  先上床再说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we're gonna put this fight on hold,and go have sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上床  今天是我排卵的最后一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sex! This is the last day I'm ovulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们现在不做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If we don't do it now..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要等到下个月了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we're gonna have to wait until next month!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.47,0:10:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便  做就做  但我不跟你说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,fine,I'll do it,but no talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且没有抱抱  而且不亲吻你脖子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} And no cuddling.  And no kissing your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  很好  反正我也很讨厌你那样做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,good! I hate it when you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我要使劲儿亲你的脖子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And lots of kissing your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管理员不在家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,well,the super's not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.85,0:10:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我妈很快就到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But my mother's gonna be here in any minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and she has the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我等不了那么久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得想想办法  把门撞倒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to do something. Knock that door down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想  但是我就跟桃子一样容易撞伤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would,but I bruise like a peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  你知道  一切都会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Besides,you know,everything's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝在睡觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The baby's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一她跳出摇篮呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if she jumps out of the bassinet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本连头都抬不起来  还想跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't hold her head up,but jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天啊  我水龙头还开着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God! I left the water running!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你没有让水龙头开着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, you did not leave the water running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  冷静一点  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please,pull yourself together,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  我有把炉子开着吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,did I leave the stove on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1996年之后你就没有煮过饭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You haven't cooked since 1996.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窗户有开着吗  如果开着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is the window open? If the window's open
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸟可能会飞进来然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}a bird could fly in and..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.07,0:10:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你知道吗  我想你说对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God,you know what? I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  其实  听  听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think, you know what, listen, listen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是鸽子  不  等等  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A pigeon. No. No,wait,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是老鹰飞进去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An eagle flew in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,飞到炉子上然后着火了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Landed on the stove and caught fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝看到这一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The baby,seeing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从公寓这边跳过去帮助老鹰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}jumps across the apartment to the mighty bird's aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而老鹰却误认为那是个攻击的行动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The eagle,however,misconstrues this as an act of aggression..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用爪子捉住婴儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and grabs the baby in its talon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这时候  水龙头的水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meanwhile,the faucet
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,充满了整间公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}fills the apartment with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝跟老鹰正熊熊燃烧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Baby and bird,still ablaze,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,双方被死亡的陷阱困住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}are locked in a death grip..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在公寓内的漩涡里旋转着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}swirling around the whirlpool that fills the apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.78,0:11:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天  如果这一切是真的你就死定了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Boy,are you gonna be sorry if that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好 嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hello.  Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经一个小时了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,领班要我问你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The maitre d' asked
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是否要考虑换到小桌子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}if you'd reconsider switching to a smaller table.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们应该先用餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we should just eat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在人还没有到齐之前你们不能点餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't order until the entire party's arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Restaurant policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那如果说另一桌离开了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,how about this? Another table leaves,right..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们的餐盘里还有食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but there's still some food left on their plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  餐厅有规定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,what's the restaurant's policy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能吃那些食物吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}about people eating that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那很恶心  但还是会发生啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} It's frowned upon.  But it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要去厕所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,I got to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不能去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人没办法保住这张桌子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't hold this table on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们要我换位子  我会屈服的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If they ask me to move,I'll cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要我留下来  我会尿裤子的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,if you ask me to stay,I'll pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上好  小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good evening,miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Miss? Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  算了  我换位子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,fine,I'll move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你不需要动手动脚的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. You don't have to manhandle me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Where?  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:53.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于  你们到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Finally. You guys made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  这些人是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe,who the hell..?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多花点时间在领带上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Spend more time with the tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样可以生出小孩来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That will make a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没办法跟你做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't make love to you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正吵架呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}while we're fighting this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  是啊  现在你可真敏感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,sure. Now you're Mr. Sensitivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当初你想在我叔叔丧礼之后做爱时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But when you wanted to have sex after my uncle's funeral..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是庆祝生命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was a celebration of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我不想这样做  听到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,I'm not gonna do this. all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真希望我们的孩子在这种情况下受孕吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this the way you want our baby to be conceived?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该在这种情况下做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We shouldn't do it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正  我很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For what it's worth,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不应该对你抽烟这件事如此刁难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I shouldn't have come down on you so hard about the smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是抽了几根烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you had a few cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不代表世界末日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Really?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不会再抽烟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And listen,I'm not gonna smoke again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我抽  我保证也会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if I do,I promise I will
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隐藏到让你看不出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}hide it so much better from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想吗  我们来庆祝生命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Want to?  Let's celebrate life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  感谢上帝你没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,thank God you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉我们抛下你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈咪再也不会离开你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mommy will never leave you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也  再也不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never,ever,ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. So let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是说真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在经历过刚刚的事之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After what just happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会离开她了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm never leaving her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解  分离是很煎熬的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I understand. Separation is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次我要离开罗斯去美容院\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One time I was about to leave Ross to go to the beauty parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就变得很不开心  他把衣服脱光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And he got so upset he took off all his clothes..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把小鸡鸡夹在双腿间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}tucked his willy between his legs..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后哭喊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and cried out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈咪  我是女生 带我跟你去"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Mommy,I'm a girl. Take me with you."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而  时光飞逝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Somehow,over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在跟你分开已经变得容易很多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it got easier to be apart from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我们还是不要说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Let's not talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你抽烟的事还是很生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am still so mad at you for smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你说你已经原谅我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you said you forgave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是几根烟  没什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was just a couple of cigarettes,no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那样说是因为我正在排卵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just said that because I was ovulating
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你却说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and you said
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们在吵架  你是不会跟我做爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you wouldn't have sex if we were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你骗我跟你上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You tricked me to get me into bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我得到我想要的了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. I got mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得被利用了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I feel so used.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们不会来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,I guess they're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想点餐了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to just order?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服务生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Waiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好了  我会说很快  所以记好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,this is gonna go fast,so try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意大利扁面配松露切片 以及肋眼牛排\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Risotto with shaved truffles and the rib steak..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.95,0:16:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加上酥炸鸡油菇和波尔多红酒酱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with the golden chanterelles and the Bordelaise sauce..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.58,0:16:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望我以上说的不包括"蜗牛"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}unless any of that stuff I just said means "snails."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蕃茄馅饼  你建议哪种面呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tomato tart,and which of the pastas would you recommend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两种都很美味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,well they're both exquisite..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两种都要  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Both it is. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以有个特殊要求吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,can I make a special request?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以什么菜先好了就先端上来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you bring everything as it's ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前菜  前餐  我们不介意  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Appetizers,entrees,we don't care.  Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以等你们继续点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll wait to put your order in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们迟到一个多小时了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You guys are over an hour late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事  很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} What happened to you two?  So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被锁在公寓外面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We got locked out of the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是好借口  可以给我吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a great story. Can I eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后瑞秋在犹豫是不是可以丢下宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then Rachel wasn't sure she could leave the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是很容易  但今天是你生日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It wasn't easy,but it's your birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了我必须要做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吧台那边是朱迪跟艾玛吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's Judy over there at the bar with Emma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是最好的解决方式\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.85,0:16:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我才不会分心  担心艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not distracted,worrying about Emma..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在家有没有事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}how she's doing at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得一心一意跟你们待在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I'm gonna be completely here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  她吐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,she spit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她吐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} What?   She spit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朱迪  她吐 朱迪  醒醒  朱迪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Judy? She spit.. Judy,look alive,Judy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Thank you.  Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每道菜看起来都很美味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,everything looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该点什么呢  我该点什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What should I have? What should I have?
